            <ArticleTitle>[Pain in elderly people suffering from dementia].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>16-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The prevalence of pain increases with age. An increase in the pain threshold and pain tolerance is sometimes observed in elderly people suffering from dementia. Hetero-assessment of pain with validated tools is essential in these patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
